<title>USA: Oryx Energy files $500 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Oryx Energy files $500 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oryx Energy Co filed Monday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $500 million in debt securities, preferred stock and common shares.</p>
<p>The oil and gas exploration company said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include repaying outstanding debt and capital expenditures.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
